            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2039539?u=7cb9b6250995d423bee5d72da0331e91fe58baab&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Draft:</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-target-group\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-5/#scroll-target-group</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Only works in Chrome 140 so far</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5189126177161216?gate=5135644355198976\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5189126177161216?gate=5135644355198976</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3149554412\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1251\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1251/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1251\">mozilla/standards-positions#1251</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Might be related to scroll-marker-group</p>",
