            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133189?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Just wanted to add <code class=\"notranslate\">hidden=until-found</code> has been added to Safari on July 7, 2025 via this pull request:<a href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/pull/47684\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/WebKit/pull/47684/hovercard\">Enable hidden=until-found in Safari Technology Preview #47684</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I'm running Safari 26 currently; <code class=\"notranslate\">hidden=until-found</code> is behind a feature flag.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7356",
            "title": "hidden=until-found added to Safari",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-14T05:34:39.000Z",
