        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11479594?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Specification: <a href=\"https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-event-clipboardchange\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://w3c.github.io/clipboard-apis/#clipboard-event-clipboardchange</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Not currently supported in any browser (I don't think?).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Blink: <a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41442253\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/41442253</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7303",
            "title": "Add `clipboardchange` event",
            "date_modified": "2025-07-06T20:45:14.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-04-04T20:25:37.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "nasso",
                "url": "https://github.com/nasso"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/161883?u=2cd1c5497b953aa913ed207fe9bcf62e6820faab&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The CSS Working Group has <a href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9350#issuecomment-1939628591\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/9350/hovercard\">resolved to adopt this proposal</a>, and begin drafting a new specification for CSS Mixins &amp; Functions.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-mixins-1/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/bvi4D7eD7wI/m/djYVLu6OAwAJ?pli=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/bvi4D7eD7wI/m/djYVLu6OAwAJ?pli=1</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://css.oddbird.net/sasslike/mixins-functions/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css.oddbird.net/sasslike/mixins-functions/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://www.bram.us/2025/02/09/css-custom-functions-teaser/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.bram.us/2025/02/09/css-custom-functions-teaser/</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/Fyrd/caniuse/issues/7301",
