        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153960?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">There is a new exciting feature <code class=\"notranslate\">Declarative Web Push</code>: <a href=\"https://webkit.org/blog/16535/meet-declarative-web-push/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://webkit.org/blog/16535/meet-declarative-web-push/</a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Would be awesome if this could be added.</p>",
