        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2644614?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The <a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#selectordef-search-text\" rel=\"nofollow\">::search-text</a> pseudo-element represents text identified by the user agent's find-in-page feature.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#selectordef-search-text\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://drafts.csswg.org/css-pseudo-4/#selectordef-search-text</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Igalia/explainers/blob/main/css/find-in-page/README.md\">https://github.com/Igalia/explainers/blob/main/css/find-in-page/README.md</a></li>\n<li>Chrome:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5195073796177920\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5195073796177920</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/339298411\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/339298411</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Firefox: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2621679975\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1103\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1103/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/1103\">mozilla/standards-positions#1103</a></li>\n<li>Safari: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2621707366\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/421\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/421/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/421\">WebKit/standards-positions#421</a></li>\n<li>Via\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@tomayac@toot.cafe/114227557613208897\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://mastodon.social/@tomayac@toot.cafe/114227557613208897</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blogs.igalia.com/schenney/find-in-page-highlight-styling/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://blogs.igalia.com/schenney/find-in-page-highlight-styling/</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>",
